 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xQdnAbxlghEQ7kNvwGBDXI3&_nc_oc=Adp68jhGGS4YVZiDvG8l2oyQTKSTRfqCBaqwRy-KOPp6LA2W0FC5-cuR8sQ16lWZle0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8LKTuD9FGYLpILVko-Vh0VOpdhGjESUa2SxBHvhY2mAA&oe=6A24407E"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Xd_mBJ6nQsQ7kNvwEk1dDQ&_nc_oc=Ado48VudKCcgWK0Ft6LuEa2UxJiwD_rp8pP7e1rxm2EYK8X_TXytV-zfUobgl4iCNNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_iTHl4qIF7QB5rIKbTiltd7gtn7ezRdVmKOkMst0qGCg&oe=6A243EC6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_